#: ../../source/reference/collider.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Collider class provides a foundation for creating collision shapes "
"within a physics environment. It can be attached to a RigidBody for "
"dynamic interactions or placed directly in the physics world for static "
"collisions. Derived classes should implement specific collision shape "
"creation in the shape() method. The class also includes methods for "
"managing collision contacts, emitting signals, and visualizing the "
"collider in the editor."
msgstr ""

